## 中文

1. 发布 v0.1.5 版本，补充 iPhone18 系列中国大陆机型编码并更新示例配置
2. 修复飞书机器人未配置签名密钥时静默不推送的问题
3. 增加 HTTP 全局超时，单个机型或推送渠道异常不再中断整轮监控
4. 配置缺失或校验不通过时明确报错退出，不再静默挂起
5. 修复日志文件被两个 appender 重复写入、启动即清空历史日志的问题
6. 精简打包依赖，fat jar 体积由 11MB 降至 4.9MB，版本号统一收敛到 pom properties
7. 修复 Dockerfile 产物名与已归档的 GitHub Actions
8. 适配新版库存查询接口与 JDK 构建，并对苹果接口返回空 body 增加保护 @mgbaozi

## English

1. Release v0.1.5: add the mainland China part numbers for the iPhone 18 family and refresh the sample config
2. Stop silently skipping Feishu bots that have no signing secret configured
3. Add a global HTTP timeout, so one failing model or push channel no longer aborts the whole run
4. Exit with a clear error instead of hanging silently when the config is missing or invalid
5. Fix two appenders writing the same log file, which wiped the history log on every start
6. Slim the fat jar from 11MB to 4.9MB and centralize all versions in pom properties
7. Fix the Dockerfile artifact name and replace the archived GitHub Actions
8. Adapt to the new inventory API and the JDK build, and guard against a missing Apple response body @mgbaozi